  m_Name: 6. Sixth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialCardData
  text: Accidentals are represented only as sharps in our game. They are shown with
    a sharp symbol (#) placed in front of the note. Sharp notes are played on the
    black key directly above and to the right of the white key that shares the same
    position on the staff.
